# StreamVersion 1.2
# Clicking a camera node in the scene tree looks through that camera. The click used to call the
# importer from inside the ImGui frame, which runs in the render pass while the active camera is a
# throwaway copy: the row got selected and the view never moved. It now sends scene_tree_activate,
# run between frames on the real camera, and the new view has to be what is on screen.
RenderEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
# Settle, then click the "Camera 1" row
TimerEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
